  "lizq": [
    {
      "line": "El Señor esté con vosotros., (Sol,,14)(La,m,213)",
      "sC": "pa"
    },
    {
      "line": "Y CON TU ESPÍRITU., (Sol,,14)(La,m,140)",
      "sC": "ta as"
    },
    {
      "line": "Levantemos el corazón., (Fa,,10)(Mi,,202)",
      "sC": "pa"
    },
    {
      "line": "LO TENEMOS LEVANTADO HACIA EL SEÑOR., (Fa,,20)(Mi,,395)",
      "sC": "ta as"
    },
    {
      "line": "Demos gracias al Señor, nuestro Dios., (La,m,338)",
      "sC": "pa"
    },
    {
      "line": "ES JUSTO Y NECESARIO., (Sol,,47)(La,m,185)",
      "sC": "ta as r1"
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1"
    },
    {
      "line": "En verdad es justo darte gracias,, (Mi,m,20)",
      "sC": "pa"
    },
    {
      "line": "Señor, Padre santo, ",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "Dios todopoderoso y eterno., (Sol,,226)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "Te alabamos, te bendecimos y te glorificamos, (La,,10)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "por el misterio de la Virgen Madre., (Mi,m,292)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1"
    },
    {
      "line": "Porque, si del antiguo adversario nos vino la ruina,",
      "sC": "width"
    },
    {
      "line": "en el seno virginal de la hija de Sión ha germinado, (Sol,,453)",
      "sC": "width"
    },
    {
      "line": "aquel que nos nutre con el pan de los ángeles,,(La,,10) ",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "y ha brotado para todo el género humano,",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "la salvación y la paz.  (Mi,m,192)",
      "sC": ""
    }
  ],
  "lder": [
    {
      "line": "La gracia que Eva nos arrebató, (Sol,,14)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "nos ha sido devuelta en María., (Mi,m,273)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "En ella, madre de todos los hombres,, (La,m,20)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "la maternidad, ",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "redimida del pecado y de la muerte,",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "se abre al don de una vida nueva.(Mi,m,287) ",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1"
    },
    {
      "line": "Así, donde había crecido el pecado,, (Sol,,302)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "se ha desbordado tu misericordia, (La,,10)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "en Cristo, nuestro Salvador., (Mi,m,244)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1"
    },
    {
      "line": "Por eso nosotros,, (Sol,,14)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "mientras esperamos la venida de Cristo,, (Mi,m,351)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "unidos a los ángeles y a los santos,, (La,m,20)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "cantamos el himno de tu gloria:, (Mi,m,265)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1"
    },
    {
      "line": "SANTO, SANTO, SANTO... ",
      "sC": "ta as"
    },
